Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

Share-alike is deliberate. The documents contain a set of refusals — the
anti-features constitution and the nine seals — and the point of a refusal is
that it cannot be quietly dropped from a derivative.

