## 3. What this licence does not cover

**The source text.** *The Nectar of Devotion* is © Bhaktivedanta Book Trust
International and is not part of this repository. `scripts/fetch-source.sh`
retrieves a local copy for reference; it is gitignored and not licensed here.

**The person.** The persona document is a design reconstruction of a
historical figure, written for product purposes. It is not a translation, an
authorised teaching, or a statement by or on behalf of any ācārya, institution
or lineage.
